==Battleground==
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Big Sal]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just use basic Big Sal and Oldhorn strategies along with some Cat Worker [[Cat Combo]]s. Spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] (or some other high-DPS unit) and [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight]] (ideally, your Ectoweights in front of Oldhorn and keep knocking back the Sals. If one somehow gets past your stack, an Ectoweight arriving to the stack should set him back in place. Breakerblast is useful) until the Oldhorn is killed, and then spawn [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to destroy the base. Note that this isn't a lure strategy. You will slowly get pushed back by the Oldhorn so you need to meet Oldhorn in the middle of the stage.

